      "writtenOn": "2021-01-11T23:00:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What duration does the TCPC check CC for the configured number of transients to detect whether it\u0027s idle?\nBy \"transient,\" do you mean a high-low or low-high transition on the wire?\n\nComment:\nBit 7 \u003cFIELD NAME\u003e: Wait for tReceive before retrying transmit in response to a bad GoodCRC.\nBit 6:4 \u003cFIELD NAME\u003e: Consider CC to be idle if there are 7 or fewer BMC transients observed in \u003cDURATION\u003e, an increase from the default of 3.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 72,
        "startChar": 0,
